# One thousand dynamic spheres demonstrate collision response and settling.
# Press Simulate for physics or Play for the runtime scene; Stop restores the authored arrangement.
# Each sphere combines a visual mesh, SphereColliderComponent and dynamic RigidBodyComponent.
# Tune radius, mass, friction and restitution to change contact and rolling behavior.
# The static ground provides collision independently of the sphere visuals.

